| g5-choose-sources: three sources weighed, a group-written encyclopedia as a starting map | 2 | g6-group-wiki | The group-written encyclopedia's references and edit history; owns AASL.IV.C.1 |
| g5-first-lateral-check: leaving the page to see who is behind it (lateral-reading) | 2 | g6-lateral-reading | Lateral reading as the method, going upstream to the original; owns AASL.VI.A.3 |
| g5-evidence-notes: notes from three sources, agreement and difference on facts | 3 | g6-point-of-view | The point of view a source takes; owns AASL.II.A.2 |
