weeks 12 to 15; the year-end check in week 28, the last week before grade 5's core year-end cluster (29 to 32), so its
two respond days, not a check, fall in weeks 29 and 30. Week 28 also holds the health grade 5 year-end check; the
after-core rule forbids only the core weeks, and any stagger among the after-core courses is the lead's one calendar
