| g5-share-real-audience | e5-presenting (reporting on a topic with media for an audience) | Unit 4, weeks 22 to 27 | ela grade 5 unit 3 (days 84 to 123), weeks 17 to 25: before or beside this unit | Unit 4's show-me day models choosing a form for an audience itself; the spoken delivery is ELA's |

