science (30). Weeks 14 and 29 also hold the health grade 4 checks; the after-core rule forbids only the core weeks, and
any stagger among the after-core courses is the lead's one calendar pass (For the lead, item 3).

## Cross-subject

Every lean is to a grade 4 core course, the same year, so each is on the availability calendar. Course days and weeks
for the other courses are as their frames state them and data/plans/calendar.csv places them; exact lesson-level
availability waits on their scopes and sequences, so each lean keeps its "if later" line. Library is not a core
course, so no core course assumes it (lesson 32).

